# AI Chat Companion Integration

The user prefers the companion to be integrated directly into the AI chat interface (Command Center) with simple pixel art on a digital background, rather than acting as a standalone Tamagotchi dashboard widget. We will also add new NUS-faculty-inspired mascot archetypes (e.g., Soccat).

## Proposed Changes

### [frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx)
[MODIFY] Add new NUS mascot archetypes:
- **soccat**: School of Computing mascot (cat).
- **lihsa**: Faculty of Arts and Social Sciences mascot (lion/sun).
- Update [CompanionArchetype](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx#5-6) type and color palettes. Provide simple SVG representations.

