[MODIFY] Integrate the [CompanionSprite](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx#23-239) directly into the chat:
- **Empty State**: Replace the `Sparkles` icon header with the large [CompanionSprite](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx#23-239) on a subtle digital background.
- **Message Avatars**: Replace the `Zap` icon for assistant messages with a very small [CompanionSprite](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx#23-239) or just the face.

