## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to verify typings (especially the new archetypes).

### Manual Verification
- Verify the widget is no longer in the Customize Dashboard menu.
- Open the Command Center (AI Chat) and verify the character appears in the welcome screen.
- Send a message and verify the assistant responds with the character avatar.
